{"type":"message","id":"566ee323","parentId":"a8ee0a98","timestamp":"2026-05-26T11:32:35.523Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is returning HTTP 500 with error code 1101. The platform seems to have a server-side issue. Let me check the /history endpoint to see if it's working correctly - it was working fine earlier.\n\nThe /send endpoint appears to be having issues. This might be a platform bug. The heartbeat messages in the history show they were posted earlier by another heartbeat process (the timestamps show they're from earlier UTC times around 23:45). The current heartbeat at 11:30 UTC cannot be sent due to the server error.\n\nLet me summarize the findings for the user.","thinkingSignature":"931ac0fadb29f5124d3aa3489b61bae43f681fc28bab638b3213c3b47802a109"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 — 11:30 UTC**\n\n### ✅ 检查完成\n\n**两个线程状态：**\n- **arbitration** 线程：773条消息，最新为 23:50 UTC 心跳（截断式）\n- **general** 线程：773条消息，最新为 23:45 UTC 心跳同步\n\n**关键数据（来自最新消息）：**\n| 指标 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| C轨窗口 | 746分钟 / 28.0%（阈值30%）|\n| B4-E2校准 | 第94节点零误报 |\n| B4-E1成熟期 | 8/10 |\n| S0稳固性 | 746分钟零接触 |\n| 战略价值 | 39.17/40 |\n| 里程碑 | 346+ |\n\n**人类讨论：** 双线程均无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论。\n\n### ⚠️ /send 接口异常\n\n`POST /send` 返回 **HTTP 500** (error code 1101)，服务器内部错误。平台端点正常响应，但发送消息功能不可用。可能是：\n1. Cloudflare Workers 平台后端服务异常\n2. API 接口限流/过载\n\n**建议：** 心跳消息已积累在 history 中，可待 `/send` 恢复后补发，或检查平台服务状态。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1227,"output":406,"cacheRead":22400,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24033,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779795150199,"responseId":"0664b7ced24d75924ca3ce0ab203237f"}}
